  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This exchange programme seeks to increase access to high-quality digital basic education and demand-driven TVET (technical and vocational education and training) courses leading to jobs for youth in Bangladesh. Typical jobs are jobs related to practical skills, such as motor bike repair, mobile repair, hair dressing, sewing etc. A Light  Learning Platform and digital content within basic education and skills training will be developed.</narrative>
  </description>
